{
 "title": "就地修改：match lend",
 "blocks": [
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "和函数参数一样，`match` 也有模式。默认情况下（`match s:`）它只读取数据。用 `match lend s:` 可以**就地修改变体内部的数据**；模式中的名字会变成 `lend` 引用。"
  },
  {
   "t": "code",
   "code": [
    "enum Item:",
    "    Weapon(i32)",
    "    Empty",
    "",
    "fn upgrade(item: lend Item):",
    "    match lend item:",
    "        Item.Weapon(power):",
    "            power += 10",
    "        Item.Empty:",
    "            pass",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    sword = Item.Weapon(50)",
    "    upgrade(sword)",
    "    match sword:",
    "        Item.Weapon(p):",
    "            print(\"power:\", p)",
    "        Item.Empty:",
    "            pass"
   ],
   "run": true,
   "output": [
    "power: 60"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "text": "第三种模式 `match consume s:` 会接管所有权，并把数据移动给新的所有者；用于包含 `String`/`List` 等类型的变体。"
  },
  {
   "t": "exercise",
   "id": "c06-l05-x1",
   "prompt": "编写 `double_it(c: lend Cell)`：如果是 `Cell.Number(n)`，就把 `n` 翻倍；如果是 `Cell.Blank`，什么也不做。用 `Number(21)` 试一试并输出结果。",
   "starter": [
    "enum Cell:",
    "    Number(i32)",
    "    Blank",
    "",
    "fn double_it(c: lend Cell):",
    "    pass",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    c = Cell.Number(21)",
    "    double_it(c)",
    "    match c:",
    "        Cell.Number(n):",
    "            print(n)",
    "        Cell.Blank:",
    "            pass"
   ],
   "solution": [
    "enum Cell:",
    "    Number(i32)",
    "    Blank",
    "",
    "fn double_it(c: lend Cell):",
    "    match lend c:",
    "        Cell.Number(n):",
    "            n *= 2",
    "        Cell.Blank:",
    "            pass",
    "",
    "fn main():",
    "    c = Cell.Number(21)",
    "    double_it(c)",
    "    match c:",
    "        Cell.Number(n):",
    "            print(n)",
    "        Cell.Blank:",
    "            pass"
   ],
   "hint": "写 `match lend c:`，并在 `Cell.Number(n)` 分支中写 `n *= 2`。",
   "expected": [
    "42"
   ]
  },
  {
   "t": "quiz",
   "id": "c06-l05-q1",
   "q": "哪种 `match` 形式可以就地修改变体内部的数据？",
   "options": [
    "`match s:`",
    "`match lend s:`",
    "`match read s:`"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "why": "`lend` 用于修改；默认的 `match` 只读取。"
  }
 ]
}
